VER-MUTATION-CHANGED: and in src/and.ts is tested only where both inputs are equal, so no test
tells `a && b` from `a || b`. Only a logical connector (LCR) mutant survives on that line; with
Stryker's LogicalOperator mutator excluded, the case fails. Stryker kills its three other mutants
on the line, and 3 of 4 clears level B's threshold of 65, so the component is at level A (80).

